# CHANGELOG.md is auto-generated from `git log` by
# apps/desktop/scripts/stamp-build.mjs on every prebuild. Gitignored
# because committing it would churn on every commit + make the
# working tree "dirty" after every npm run dev/build cycle.
CHANGELOG.md

# Experimental 3D nav-icon source (Topview .glb + previews). Not
# referenced anywhere in apps/desktop/src as of 2026-05-11. ~25 MB.
# Keep locally for prototyping; if/when wired up, either commit then
# (with LFS for the .glb files) or leave ignored.
/apps/desktop/src/assets/nav-icons/3d/

